<title>USA: Lockheed Martin wins stealth support work.</title>
<headline>Lockheed Martin wins stealth support work.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Air Force said Monday it has awarded Lockheed Martin's Skunk Works unit in Palmdale, Calif., a $133 million contract for services for F-117A stealth fighter planes.</p>
<p>It said the contract is for services over the next year.</p>
</text>
